    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\frac{\\partial \\textbf{D}}{\\partial t}^n_{i,j,k}\\approx\\frac{D_{i,j,k}^{n+1}-2D_{i,j,k}^n+D_{i,j,k}^n }{h^2}$$"
